10:- [ ] **6 Entry door + transom**: back wall z=10 x11..12 y5..7: `crimson_door` (two doors side by side, hinges outward, facing north) with hung `glass_pane` transom at (11..12,8,10); casing smooth_quartz stairs/slabs both sides; lantern hanging in porch at (12,8,8) (`lantern` hanging=true). P4. Vocab: `entryDoor`.
27:- [ ] **23 Interior (rooms)**: entry hall + long stair along E party wall (x13..14 z11..16), parlour behind bay with fireplace x=1 z11..13, dining, kitchen to garden, upstairs bedrooms front/back, bathroom clawfoot tub, top-floor room under the roof with skylight. Built by the rooms' designers; P1 builds the shells, partitions, slabs, stairs.

